- Caching of reccurent and constant infos at least: 
    - Currencies
    - Units
    - Permissions


Resource design
    list of products doesn't include variants 
    product detail include variants
    list of variants doesn't include product since you need product_id to do it
    variant detail need the product detail but without other variants to avoid loop
    create a product do all the things needed
    update a product, update the product and sync categories so product + categories (sans variants and optionValues) in response
    create a variant would be bulk so list of the all variants without product relation
    update a variant would be for unique and could cause inconsistence with creation but variant detail + unit only, prices will have his own, addmany-update-deletemany


---

CATEGORY
[x] GET    /categories                  → list (avec parent si besoin de l'arbre)
[x] POST   /categories                  → create > category
[x] GET    /categories/{id}             → show > category + parent + children
[x] PATCH  /categories/{id}             → update > category
[x] DELETE /categories/{id}             → delete
[x] GET    /categories/{id}/products    → les products de cette categorie

PRODUCTS
[x] GET    /products                    → list (categories + optionValues, sans variants)
[] POST   /products                    → create > product complet (tout)
[x] GET    /products/{id}               → show > product + categories + optionValues + variants
[] PATCH  /products/{id}               → update (infos + sync categories) > product + categories + optionValues
[] DELETE /products/{id}               → delete

VARIANTS
[] GET    /products/{id}/variants      → list (sans product)
[] POST   /products/{id}/variants      → bulk create > liste des variants du produit (sans product)
[] GET    /variants/{id}               → show > variant complet + product light
[] PATCH  /variants/{id}               → update > variant + unit (sans product, sans prices)
[] DELETE /variants/{id}               → delete

CURRENCIES (only list)
[x] GET    /currencies                  → list

UNITS (pas de delete)
[x] GET    /units                      → list
[x] POST   /units/sync                 → create & update

OPTIONS
[] GET    /options                     → list (sans values)
[] POST   /options                     → create (avec values) > option + values
[] GET    /options/{id}                → show > option + values
[] PATCH  /options/{id}                → update (infos + sync values, supprime liaisons orphelines) > option + values
[] DELETE /options/{id}                → delete options and values

PRICES
[] PATCH  /variants/{id}/prices        → addMany+updateMany+deleteMany > toutes les prices du variant
{ "create": [...], "update": [...], "delete": [...] }



